51c5a05/uploads/origins/b6f69938-44e9-4ecb-9f6d-4cea6e1bccb7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a7542c61e4b84597bb7ad9e54fdf8448 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Dear Savior Teacher\nI have always loved your drawings and would like to have my own original character drawn by you.\n\nHer name is Miyuki Hoshimiya.\nShe looks sixteen, but she is actually eighteen.\nShe is an introverted, quiet and kind girl. I would like her to wear everyday modern clothes, though,\notherwise feel free to do as you wish.\nShe is frail and cannot walk due to her illness\n\nThank you for your interest!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1NX85zfvKt03Qm-8ZCbV6jbfbUiYFqLav", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Belzzird/works/17", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/59b23b71/uploads/origins/656f3cde-2a8e-4a46-96b8-fdfe3721c4c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dc8d9fe4d0ae9d7f40d31b83425e6e4d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/59b23b71/uploads/origins/656f3cde-2a8e-4a46-96b8-fdfe3721c4c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dc8d9fe4d0ae9d7f40d31b83425e6e4d, https://si.imgix.net/59b23b71/uploads/origins/656f3cde-2a8e-4a46-96b8-fdfe3721c4c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1810988f7bfd99dc47421af8b90fbd28 2x, https://si.imgix.net/59b23b71/uploads/origins/656f3cde-2a8e-4a46-96b8-fdfe3721c4c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4547d07e3c7109b48ffda6200007a67e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Nice to meet you!\nI saw your wonderful illustrations and would like to see my own character in your style and interpretation! I would like to see my own character in your style and interpretation!\n\nIf you would like, I would like to draw one of my characters, Chicarilly (blonde hair), Tonia (pink hair), and Rui Rui (black hair), as you like to do.\n\nIf there are any inconveniences with the request, I would appreciate it if you could resend it to me.\nThank you in advance.\n\nhttps://x.com/at_tetom_ctr/status/1755911935114334466?s=46", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Belzzird/works/16", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8179b660/uploads/origins/ac46031a-c7f1-4bd3-baad-d2b56eeff33f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=581717a5180f697353f39fa6790987b7", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8179b660/uploads/origins/ac46031a-c7f1-4bd3-baad-d2b56eeff33f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=581717a5180f697353f39fa6790987b7, https://si.imgix.net/8179b660/uploads/origins/ac46031a-c7f1-4bd3-baad-d2b56eeff33f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ac0ae41e6c0dfa065bf0a5521207ab17 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8179b660/uploads/origins/ac46031a-c7f1-4bd3-baad-d2b56eeff33f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f23b5698170d3d83fca7f9881e64e4da 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "I love your drawings! I would be happy if you could draw my character, please feel free to do so, thank you! 😍😍\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1Qim8f52oVxLD68rWrEDPbourJL8qGepA/view?usp=drivesdk", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Belzzird/works/15", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4431c5ff/uploads/origins/8c265d4b-a8b5-400c-9ae7-26e866cd51ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=582313dd69a1abc025912264d6aaf55c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4431c5ff/uploads/origins/8c265d4b-a8b5-400c-9ae7-26e866cd51ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=582313dd69a1abc025912264d6aaf55c, https://si.imgix.net/4431c5ff/uploads/origins/8c265d4b-a8b5-400c-9ae7-26e866cd51ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=901afa6f5f45b69045e6031f86b41f87 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4431c5ff/uploads/origins/8c265d4b-a8b5-400c-9ae7-26e866cd51ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ddfe028651963d94e2f992a262eb9344 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I love your works and how you draw girls! I would love to request you to draw my vtuber character.\n\nAny cute or cheeky pose! Also I would really love it if you gave her pink fake nails to match her outfit!\n\nKey Points:\n-Mole on her left cheek\n-Floppy dog ears\n-Fang teeth\n\nI would love to be able to use the artwork for my SNS as well. Thank you for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1gCo8uAYh0dRKWkndnvNPivIGfsv4fESt?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Belzzird/works/14", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1d4bea51/uploads/origins/0f8cd606-a9d4-4c09-83db-05d0b7999092?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ef6fdff373a98478c0a4d107250bda3a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1d4bea51/uploads/origins/0f8cd606-a9d4-4c09-83db-05d0b7999092?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ef6fdff373a98478c0a4d107250bda3a, https://si.imgix.net/1d4bea51/uploads/origins/0f8cd606-a9d4-4c09-83db-05d0b7999092?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1b17fb449c69615458e5f4f4cccd6161 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1d4bea51/uploads/origins/0f8cd606-a9d4-4c09-83db-05d0b7999092?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=91541eafdffbbefd8d946178f3f5cbc0 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Nice to meet you, my name is CMH.\n\nI have been creating and submitting a 3D tool for women's wrestling techniques, and I was wondering if you could draw an illustration of my original characters, Ayumi and Annie, who appear in the tool.\nThe smiling faces in this illustration are very nice, so I was wondering if you could do it for me.\n　https://skeb.jp/@Belzzird/works/6\nI would like the illustration to show the two of them smiling and looking friendly.\n\nCharacter material URL\n　　https://i.imgur.com/67PD7Qh.jpeg\n\nThank you very much for your consideration.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Belzzird/works/13", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/33f5207f/uploads/origins/188d703b-dbde-4163-9b5e-7217157d33d5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=528152134d2f4f5d79b53b50c2b602c4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/33f5207f/uploads/origins/188d703b-dbde-4163-9b5e-7217157d33d5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=528152134d2f4f5d79b53b50c2b602c4, https://si.imgix.net/33f5207f/uploads/origins/188d703b-dbde-4163-9b5e-7217157d33d5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ac2f2ac87cf25a962a8f8eceb8f8662f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/33f5207f/uploads/origins/188d703b-dbde-4163-9b5e-7217157d33d5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f9d87c481245b6b75d146550f84e899b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello!Nice to meet you! I like your artworks so much that I would like to invite you to draw for my original character.\n\ncharacter：a girl with red hair\nreference：\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/13qi1j9Z8snp38y-6TwGZZRjMCedGlmym\n\nPlease draw as you like！\nuse:Use: personal viewing, personal non-commercial printing.\n\nIf the content is inappropriate, please cancel the request! If the amount is not enough, please resend the request. Thank you very much!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Belzzird/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1c807695/uploads/origins/73bc8797-88d7-4550-8355-4c92fe446b37?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5842d5d8869f02626d5ecec4457362c6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1c807695/uploads/origins/73bc8797-88d7-4550-8355-4c92fe446b37?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5842d5d8869f02626d5ecec4457362c6, https://si.imgix.net/1c807695/uploads/origins/73bc8797-88d7-4550-8355-4c92fe446b37?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d9b10bb63d2890e402e91b019599eda9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1c807695/uploads/origins/73bc8797-88d7-4550-8355-4c92fe446b37?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bc7a9c609b2e6fa6517bf28aece87406 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Dear Savior, nice to meet you. I love your work, Savior, and thank you for all your wonderful work!\n\nI would like to ask you to draw my OC this time.\nI would like you to draw my OC this time.\nI love your illustrations of girls, so I would like you to draw a female version of my OC.\nPlease feel free to draw the expression and composition of my OC as you like. If you would like, I would appreciate it if you could draw her face frontal or slightly oblique, and if you could show her thighs, as her legs are very attractive!\n\nDetails\n Second year high school student (uniform with shirt open at chest)\nBlonde hair, hazel eyes, slightly protruding eyes.\nOn the surface, she is kind, popular, and cheerful, but by nature she is proud and self-centered. She tends to be sickly.\nCharacteristics of female body: gal-like, E-cup, long blonde hair, nails, firm but not thick thighs, loose socks.\n\n[Usage.\nAll with Savior's ID.\nPersonal viewing\nUse of icons for SNS, etc.\nWe may introduce them to other creators as materials when we request them to do so.\n\nWe are very sorry for your busy schedule, but we would be very grateful if you would consider our request.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-a1ipIfKfps_S2Da6QUhw0bRh3BbR8Ha", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Belzzird/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/66cfcc90/uploads/origins/3e24d9eb-cd7c-4ce4-84d1-0f6e89778626?bg=%23ff