 to draw my original character if you don't mind.\nYou can draw my character with any clothes, pose, facial expression, etc!\n\nResource:\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/16zsZ6Lyk6biSocBzH1KfkS1_5aJU0MJX/view?usp=sharing\n\nThank you for your consideration!\n\n(Sorry, we resent your request because there was an error in the content...)", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Belzzird/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/82973c86/uploads/origins/63cbdc88-7624-4d4f-b1e2-c87f6517d510?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=c0556ac9d193df15c15cf068998beb9e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/82973c86/uploads/origins/63cbdc88-7624-4d4f-b1e2-c87f6517d510?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=c0556ac9d193df15c15cf068998beb9e, https://si.imgix.net/82973c86/uploads/origins/63cbdc88-7624-4d4f-b1e2-c87f6517d510?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=48f9543ed3e611954db34932288e5f22 2x, https://si.imgix.net/82973c86/uploads/origins/63cbdc88-7624-4d4f-b1e2-c87f6517d510?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=4e32cbbb99003cf4efb8620dd41712d7 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Belzzird/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/0081ecba/uploads/origins/aa189d26-ae87-4c84-8765-84853f4db8b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=952999f81ab04818511d5305175bdca1", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0081ecba/uploads/origins/aa189d26-ae87-4c84-8765-84853f4db8b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=952999f81ab04818511d5305175bdca1, https://si.imgix.net/0081ecba/uploads/origins/aa189d26-ae87-4c84-8765-84853f4db8b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=21287b50b18a7b0f4a7e28ed8964b79e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0081ecba/uploads/origins/aa189d26-ae87-4c84-8765-84853f4db8b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5ad6fd8ae58688417966ad5b60410bb5 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi, Savior-sensei, it's nice to meet you!\nI was attracted by your wonderful illustrations, and if you don't mind, I would like to ask you to create my own original character (the girl in the resource URL).\n\nI will leave the poses, etc. to you,\nAlso, since there were multiple costumes and parodies, please feel free to choose one.\nI wish the teacher enjoyable drawing!\n\nIf possible, I would be happy to write \"Ki Ki\" in the address. I would appreciate it if you could send me all of them, some with addresses and some without addresses.\nI am sorry for the length of this message, but I would appreciate it if you would consider it.\nThank you very much for your consideration.\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1ZoGPxvNBqe-s_sXuuslPYdYMtK7bNnuy", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Belzzird/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5ebbf4ae/uploads/origins/ebb05d70-af71-46f8-8f53-05e6aa555aae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b15cf3d47b8b654d8f1105902471a360", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5ebbf4ae/uploads/origins/ebb05d70-af71-46f8-8f53-05e6aa555aae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b15cf3d47b8b654d8f1105902471a360, https://si.imgix.net/5ebbf4ae/uploads/origins/ebb05d70-af71-46f8-8f53-05e6aa555aae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6726777b7f8fa66a7b647feba9cf244c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5ebbf4ae/uploads/origins/ebb05d70-af71-46f8-8f53-05e6aa555aae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2c8a411980c89f142b6772b2fec29ad8 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Thank you for the last time.\nIf you don't mind, I would like to ask you again for the same character human pillow Rio\n\nI would like to see her in a summery swimsuit.\nI'll leave the design and pose up to you, but I like the smiling face in your illustrations, so a smiling face would be great!\n\nI'm sorry to leave it almost entirely up to you, but if it's convenient for you, I'd appreciate it if you could do it for me.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Belzzird/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/63ef005c/uploads/origins/401b597a-0bbf-4008-a2d9-f069d3e5fa0e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0f290b200c048fcedb1cabcfd76d9f73", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/63ef005c/uploads/origins/401b597a-0bbf-4008-a2d9-f069d3e5fa0e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0f290b200c048fcedb1cabcfd76d9f73, https://si.imgix.net/63ef005c/uploads/origins/401b597a-0bbf-4008-a2d9-f069d3e5fa0e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=49039f2bf4c5134f9996562254c8ba45 2x, https://si.imgix.net/63ef005c/uploads/origins/401b597a-0bbf-4008-a2d9-f069d3e5fa0e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0ae578bacebf37ba02f2d1f2879169f8 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "救世主様\n\nこんばんは、救世主様。\nツイッターからイラストを拝見させて頂いてファンになったものです。\n女の子たちの目つき、顔立ち、それに太ももあたりの表現がすごく良かったです！\nあ、女装の子もとてもきれいで可愛かったです！好き！\nそんな救世主様がスケブを開いていらっしゃることを知り、もしよろしければこちらのオリキャラのことを依頼したいです。\n\nお願い申し上げたいのはこちらのオリキャラ狐娘の万里香（まりか）という子です。\n狐耳と尻尾・赤メガネ・アホ毛、そしてちょっぴりツリ目な目つきが特徴的な、160cmくらいの身長の高校生です。\n本とか、動物や花、星空のような自然をぼーっと見るのが大好きな子です。\n性格的には、ちょっと人見知りで照れ屋ですので人前では余計にクールっぷりしてるけどまた寂しがり屋のちょっと面倒くさい感じです。一人の時や知り合いの前では表情が緩めてちょっと豊かになる感じです。\nこれだけではちょっと説明が足りないと思いますので設定と設定画など、ご参考できそうなものを下のURLにまとめております。\n\nこの娘で救世主様の絵柄でのイラストをどうかお願いしたいです。\n衣装は設定画のうちの一つで、本を持って、脚がきれいに見えるところがみたいです。他はご自由にお願いします！\nご検討くださいませ！\n\nお忙しい中、要件のみで申し訳ありません。\n応援しております！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1kVcp6B8dzGYFGpFb9spMTyDnz0TzyM7Q?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Belzzird/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/315cd7b0/uploads/origins/787b215a-e0f9-4983-8150-28607a53bfdf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9cb26c0176761c30d61eb59c4943b784", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/315cd7b0/uploads/origins/787b215a-e0f9-4983-8150-28607a53bfdf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9cb26c0176761c30d61eb59c4943b784, https://si.imgix.net/315cd7b0/uploads/origins/787b215a-e0f9-4983-8150-28607a53bfdf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=367a98799384d7f3a35e455cdc8ecf6c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/315cd7b0/uploads/origins/787b215a-e0f9-4983-8150-28607a53bfdf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c54bed7dfb9c367627dfdafbd9bfde43 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi Savior, nice to meet you!\nI have been looking at your wonderful illustrations for a long time. If you don't mind, I would like to request an illustration of an original character from you.\nPlease refer to the URL for the character's setting.\nPlease leave all composition and poses to Mr. Savior!\nYou are free to post your illustrations on social networking sites.\n\nThank you very much in advance.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/10FGsnd3V6zTj6VwS-tC-5kgiBcab15Af/view?usp=drivesdk", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Belzzird/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/bc2c2184/uploads/origins/70a64122-71de-4a82-a209-4830745e653e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=b