わら帽子に花が付いていると嬉しいです。花の種類はお任せします。\nその他も救世主さんにお任せしたいと思います。\nよろしくお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Belzzird/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/26aeaded/uploads/origins/3688f9bb-bc25-4f4d-a35d-4dbba58645ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6884585e50a4101c5623df0c5d9dcc84", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/26aeaded/uploads/origins/3688f9bb-bc25-4f4d-a35d-4dbba58645ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6884585e50a4101c5623df0c5d9dcc84, https://si.imgix.net/26aeaded/uploads/origins/3688f9bb-bc25-4f4d-a35d-4dbba58645ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fa62658f59c9b3d3a6220843a4964f27 2x, https://si.imgix.net/26aeaded/uploads/origins/3688f9bb-bc25-4f4d-a35d-4dbba58645ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3fae52ce7a13ee6e333aa31acb39ceb0 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello savior!\nI've been waiting for you to open a skeb.\nIf you would like, I would like you to draw a human pillow Rio of my creation character.\n\nYou can wear any clothes except the cardboard in the URL.\nI'll leave the composition and pose to you.\n\nHere are some of the most popular drawings\n(https://twitter.com/belzzird/status/1622774138418130945?s=61&t=E6klqeI8ps6wEkPDUMRLTg)\n(https://twitter.com/belzzird/status/1557283298077843456?s=61&t=PGCi0LeI1RgBCxj-liNIQA)\nI like the expression and soft lines of the brown-haired girl in this picture.\n\nIf you don't mind, I'd appreciate it.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/gosyu09/status/1624297163244318721?s=61&t=MdLW6GWTklwVVPFqfhUyig", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}